  "description": "A live mirror of a remote device: a freshness heartbeat, the screen it is drawing (or its headline), a relayed countdown, a state word and a live banner. The card is a second view of the hardware, not a dashboard about it. Lifted from galactic-unicorn-remote's panel mirror.",
